<title>SHARJAH: SOCCER-UAE BEAT JORDAN 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UAE BEAT JORDAN 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH (UNITED ARAB EMIRATES 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Arab Emirates beat Jordan 2-0 (halftime 1-0) in their Asian group three World Cup qualifying match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>UAE - Adnan Taliyani 26, Khamis Saad 48.</p>
<p>Attendance - 16,000.</p>
</text>
